    {
      "id": "shape:n-gaps",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 3260,
      "rotation": 0,
      "index": "b1hVPX",
      "parentId": "page:QTp-1nzT39i4UZK1uJC3i",
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "color": "light-red",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Gaps to decide later"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Write a real triage skill (hub is currently tribal)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Add labels: needs-grill, needs-spec, ready-for-review."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. When does grilling become grill-with-docs? Default: if CONTEXT.md or ADRs exist, or the work will create them."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Bug path: still an issue. Small bug → Path A + tdd. Foggy bug → Path C research ticket, then red test."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "start",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "growY": 0,
        "fontSizeAdjustment": 1,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
